xt":{"content":"无人值守不是让 AI 更亢奋，而是让任务内部自带一个挑刺的评审者。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"无人值守不是让 AI 更亢奋，而是让任务内部自带一个挑刺的评审者。","href":null}],"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-8185-a463-ed33f03e95f6","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"bulleted_list_item","bulleted_list_item":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"好的提示词不是一句命令，而是一张目标工单：目标、规则、验收、边界、复盘、停机条件都要写清楚。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"好的提示词不是一句命令，而是一张目标工单：目标、规则、验收、边界、复盘、停机条件都要写清楚。","href":null}],"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-80bb-b767-c72e076e50a5","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T08:22:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T08:23:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"87280683-c5bb-4550-8935-f21a199c54e0"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"87280683-c5bb-4550-8935-f21a199c54e0"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"image","image":{"caption":[],"type":"file","file":{"url":"/downloads/ai-agent-ufo-game-prompt-template-2026-37399968-1bdb-80bb-b7-20df2f16.png","expiry_time":"2026-08-23T16:26:19.056Z"}},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-81a3-b38d-e7be10f3a257","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"heading_2","heading_2":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"可复用提示词模板","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"可复用提示词模板","href":null}],"is_toggleable":false,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-8103-abf1-d3e0d4db41c7","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"code","code":{"caption":[],"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"你现在不是聊天助手，而是一个可以持续推进任务的执行代理。\n\n【目标】\n我要你完成：{任务名称}\n最终交付物是：{交付物}\n使用场景是：{使用者/平台/运行环境}\n\n【背景】\n已知信息：\n- {背景1}\n- {背景2}\n- {素材/路径/约束}\n\n【规则】\n你必须遵守：\n1. 先做最小可用版本，再逐步增强。\n2. 每一步都要产生可检查的证据。\n3. 不要因为完成了一部分就总结收工。\n4. 遇到权限、依赖、路径、登录态问题时，先尝试可验证的替代方案；仍无法推进时再报告。\n\n【完成标准】\n只有同时满足以下条件，才算完成：\n- {验收项1：功能/质量/格式}\n- {验收项2：运行/截图/测试结果}\n- {验收项3：用户可直接使用}\n\n【边界】\n不要做：\n- {不要扩展的方向}\n- {不要引入的复杂度}\n- {不要改动的文件/数据/账号设置}\n\n【自我评审】\n每轮完成后，你要扮演评审者，检查：\n- 目标是否真的完成？\n- 有没有证据？\n- 有没有违反边界？\n- 用户是否还需要额外手动补步骤？\n\n【停机条件】\n只有在完成标准全部通过后，才允许输出最终总结。\n如果未通过，继续迭代，不要把“已完成部分”当成最终交付。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"你现在不是聊天助手，而是一个可以持续推进任务的执行代理。\n\n【目标】\n我要你完成：{任务名称}\n最终交付物是：{交付物}\n使用场景是：{使用者/平台/运行环境}\n\n【背景】\n已知信息：\n- {背景1}\n- {背景2}\n- {素材/路径/约束}\n\n【规则】\n你必须遵守：\n1. 先做最小可用版本，再逐步增强。\n2. 每一步都要产生可检查的证据。\n3. 不要因为完成了一部分就总结收工。\n4. 遇到权限、依赖、路径、登录态问题时，先尝试可验证的替代方案；仍无法推进时再报告。\n\n【完成标准】\n只有同时满足以下条件，才算完成：\n- {验收项1：功能/质量/格式}\n- {验收项2：运行/截图/测试结果}\n- {验收项3：用户可直接使用}\n\n【边界】\n不要做：\n- {不要扩展的方向}\n- {不要引入的复杂度}\n- {不要改动的文件/数据/账号设置}\n\n【自我评审】\n每轮完成后，你要扮演评审者，检查：\n- 目标是否真的完成？\n- 有没有证据？\n- 有没有违反边界？\n- 用户是否还需要额外手动补步骤？\n\n【停机条件】\n只有在完成标准全部通过后，才允许输出最终总结。\n如果未通过，继续迭代，不要把“已完成部分”当成最终交付。","href":null}],"language":"plain text"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-8124-bb0f-d72ed1fb8c0e","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"heading_2","heading_2":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"UFO 游戏版示例","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"UFO 游戏版示例","href":null}],"is_toggleable":false,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-81b8-8e2f-eadd7921f443","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"code","code":{"caption":[],"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"目标：做一个 2D 像素风 UFO 指挥小游戏。\n玩法：玩家控制飞碟吸走敌方小兵，再释放我方小兵攻击基地。\n交付：一个可直接运行的网页小游戏，包含 HTML/CSS/JS。\n验收：\n- 页面能在本地浏览器打开。\n- UFO 能移动、吸兵、释放兵。\n- 双方基地有血量，小兵能自动锁敌攻击。\n- 至少能出现胜利或失败状态。\n- 截图或自动化测试能证明游戏真的跑起来。\n边界：\n- 不做复杂联网、账号、后端。\n- 不追求完整商业游戏，只做可玩原型。\n停机：\n- 没通过验收就继续修，不要提前总结完成。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"目标：做一个 2D 像素风 UFO 指挥小游戏。\n玩法：玩家控制飞碟吸走敌方小兵，再释放我方小兵攻击基地。\n交付：一个可直接运行的网页小游戏，包含 HTML/CSS/JS。\n验收：\n- 页面能在本地浏览器打开。\n- UFO 能移动、吸兵、释放兵。\n- 双方基地有血量，小兵能自动锁敌攻击。\n- 至少能出现胜利或失败状态。\n- 截图或自动化测试能证明游戏真的跑起来。\n边界：\n- 不做复杂联网、账号、后端。\n- 不追求完整商业游戏，只做可玩原型。\n停机：\n- 没通过验收就继续修，不要提前总结完成。","href":null}],"language":"plain text"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-815e-841c-fbf886167b26","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"heading_2","heading_2":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"怎么改成任何项目","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"怎么改成任何项目","href":null}],"is_toggleable":false,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-81ce-b2d6-d670c904e0e0","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"created_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-06-02T07:53:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"把“UFO 游戏”替换成你的真实任务，把“能移动、能吸兵、能胜负”替换成你的验收证据。写文章就验收标题、结构、事实来源和发布草稿；写代码就验收运行、测试、截图和边界；做视频就验收成片、封面、字幕、平台状态。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"把“UFO 游戏”替换成你的真实任务，把“能移动、能吸兵、能胜负”替换成你的验收证据。写文章就验收标题、结构、事实来源和发布草稿；写代码就验收运行、测试、截图和边界；做视频就验收成片、封面、字幕、平台状态。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"37399968-1bdb-8138-b253-eeb8537701fe","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"37399968-1bdb-81c2-ba65-f872aeb6a641"},"cr